WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.000
Your final set of drills are waiting for you

00:03.000 --> 00:04.400
in your playbook.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.440
They are designed to help you complete

00:06.440 --> 00:10.000
your 90 day assessment and reset.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.600
Capturing your wins and setting your focus

00:12.600 --> 00:13.800
for your next season.

00:13.800 --> 00:15.480
I also ask that you complete

00:15.480 --> 00:18.280
your final post-course assessment.

00:18.280 --> 00:20.960
Your feedback is invaluable to us

00:20.960 --> 00:24.280
to help us continue to make this experience powerful

00:24.280 --> 00:26.600
for the athletes who will come after you.

00:27.600 --> 00:31.640
I am so incredibly proud of the work you've done.

00:31.640 --> 00:33.720
It has been my absolute honor

00:33.720 --> 00:36.000
to be your coach on this journey.

00:36.000 --> 00:37.800
You've stepped into the arena,

00:37.800 --> 00:39.680
you've faced the challenges,

00:39.680 --> 00:41.000
you've put in the reps,

00:41.000 --> 00:43.200
you have emerged stronger,

00:43.200 --> 00:45.760
more focused and more aligned.

00:45.760 --> 00:48.960
You are now a member of a very special

00:48.960 --> 00:50.920
community of athletes.

00:50.920 --> 00:52.440
The season may be over,

00:52.440 --> 00:55.800
but the game of life and leadership never ends.

00:55.920 --> 01:00.520
You've done the work and you've earned this moment.

01:00.520 --> 01:02.840
It's time to celebrate.

01:02.840 --> 01:06.240
Welcome to the Athleader Hall of Fame.

01:06.240 --> 01:08.120
You have everything you need.

01:08.120 --> 01:09.800
You've got this.

01:09.800 --> 01:12.320
Now, make it happen.

